{# Decorative scene for the sign-in page: editor's marks (carets, pilcrows, braces, blocks, cursors,
   squiggles) drifting on ink. Generated once with a fixed seed and kept as the ink layer's reference
   (INK.md): the marks are the mark-* symbols of icons.svg, coloured by .mc-N. Other ink places use
   folio_ink_marks(). #}
